While testing the updated Icon + Text component, I identified an inconsistency in the FE rendering. In Sanity, the default value “Above text” is selected and the changes are published, but on the UI the component automatically displays the layout as “Left of text.” The FE is not honoring the selected placement and shows the icon on the left even though “Above text” is configured.

Notably, when I tested this yesterday, the behavior matched the AC and the UI correctly reflected the selected placement. Today, the same configuration no longer produces the expected result.
